    {
      "id": "bophola",
      "number": "27",
      "heading": "ব-ফলা",
      "statement": "ব as the second member of a conjunct may hang beneath the first letter as ব-ফলা. In many words it no longer sounds as a full ব; দ্ব and ত্ব keep the spelling while the pronunciation has moved on.",
      "examples": [
        {
          "target": "বিদ্বান",
          "roman": "biddan",
          "gloss": "learned person"
        }
      ],
